      "traditional": "我喜歡我的主人，他叫大星。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan wǒ de zhǔ rén tā jiào dà xīng",
      "english": "I like my owner. He is called Daxing."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我喜欢和大星在一起，我们可以一起看电影，一起买东西，一起玩。",
      "traditional": "我喜歡和大星在一起，我們可以一起看電影，一起買東西，一起玩。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xǐ huan hé dà xīng zài yì qǐ wǒ men kě yǐ yì qǐ kàn diàn yǐng yì qǐ mǎi dōng xi yì qǐ wán",
      "english": "I like being together with Daxing. We can watch movies together, buy things together, and have fun together."
