    "sentence_translations": [
      "(1) The Xiaomi Phone",
      "",
      "I am a cell phone. My name is Xiaomi, and you can call me the Xiaomi phone.",
      "",
      "I like my owner. He is called Daxing.",
      "I like being together with Daxing. We can watch movies together, buy things together, and have fun together.",
      "Sometimes Daxing needs to study or have fun with his girlfriend, so he can’t be with me.",
      "It’s also okay if we’re not together. If Daxing is happy, then I am happy.",
      "",
      "In the morning, Daxing said, “Xiaomi, what’s the weather like today?”",
      "",
      "I said, “Today, the weather isn’t good. It’s raining.”",
      "",
      "At noon, Daxing said, “Xiaomi, open Facebook.”",
      "",
      "I said, “Sure.” I opened Facebook.",
      "",
      "At night, Daxing said, “Xiaomi, Facetime my girlfriend.”",
      "",
      "I heard Daxing call me, and I was extremely happy. I said, “I’m here! I’m here!”",
      "",
      "I was able to help Daxing. I was so happy."
    ]
